{
    "title": "Weather Forecast - Live Radar",
    "description": "\u2600\ufe0f <b><font color=\"#9457EB\"> Daily Weather Forecast - Live Weather Forecast, Weather Forecast - Radar</font></b> is an application that helps you constantly update weather information right on your smartphone.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf32 <b><font color=\"#9457EB\">Weather Forecast - Local Weather </font></b> shows you temperature \ud83c\udf21\ufe0f, air quality \ud83c\udf43, chance of rain \u2600\ufe0f, updates storm situation \ud83c\udf0a, extreme weather conditions \ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f or cool weather days \u2600\ufe0f.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0e <b><font color=\"#9457EB\">Live Weather Forecast App - Weather Forecast, Live Radar</font></b> Global weather tracker is constantly updated with more than 150 countries and more than 180,000 cities around the world.\r\n\r\n\u2603\ufe0f <b><font color=\"#9457EB\">Weather forecast \u2013 Local Weather</font></b> show rainfall by minute, weather radar support, current area warning severe weather, forecast of the amount of snowfall every minute. Weather forecast up to 120 hours and 30 days.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 <b><font color=\"#9457EB\"> MAIN FEATURES: </font></b> \ud83c\udf08\r\n\r\n\u2614 <b>ACCURATE WEATHER:</b>\r\n- Detailed weather forecast: Forecast temperature in degrees Fahrenheit or Celsius, sunrise and sunset times according to your local weather time zone\r\n- Update parameters of wind direction, precipitation, pressure, monitor the possibility of rain, storm, snow and rainfall and snowfall in 24 hours.\r\n- Hourly maximum and lowest temperature updates\r\n- Provide information about air quality AQI with indicators PM2.5, CO, O3, PM10, NO2, SO2\r\n- Warning of air pollution levels by levels, UV index, humidity (%), ...\r\n\r\n\u2614 <b>HOURLY AND DAILY WEATHER FORECAST:</b>\r\n- Help you monitor live weather anytime, anywhere\r\n- Weather forecast today, weather tomorrow\r\n- Detailed weather forecast up to 120 hours helps you predict weather trends and have more perfect plans\r\n- Daily weather forecast up to 30 days.\r\n\r\n\u2614 <b>WEATHER WARNING:</b>\r\n- Promptly notify you of bad weather conditions, extreme weather may occur in the near future\r\n- Timely local weather warnings for rainfall, storm journey, heavy rain, high winds, sleet and frost\r\n- Warning of weather indicators that may affect health\r\n\r\n\u2614 <b>MANAGE LOCATION, CITY:</b>\r\n- Daily weather updates for most cities in the world\r\n- You can add, edit and delete locations you want to track weather; forecast for multiple locations easily.\r\n- Update the exact weather where you live\r\n- Choose the location you are interested in the weather forecast right on the map\r\n\r\n\u2614 <b>UPDATE PRINCIPLE, FROZEN, SNOW BY MINUTES:</b>\r\n- Forecast the possibility of rain, precipitation, snowfall and possibility of snowfall for the next 120 minutes\r\n- Help you have more detailed plans and plans for upcoming activities\r\n\r\n\u2614 <b>WEATHER RADAR MAP</b>\r\n- Weather forecast application provides weather radar map to help you more intuitively track wind direction, wind speed, temperature, UV index, etc. globally\r\n\r\n\u2614 <b>Weather Utilities</b>\r\n- The weather forecast widget has a diverse, eye-catching interface that is easy to use\r\n- You can easily select and add weather widgets to your home screen\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f <b><font color=\"#9457EB\">Live Weather Forecast application, Weather Forecast - Live Weather </font></b>has a beautiful interface and is very easy to use, easy to follow Accurate weather forecast indicators. You just need to select the location, the location to monitor the weather, the application will display the weather data you are interested in quickly and accurately. Real-time local weather forecast at your current location.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f No matter where you are, you will receive weather forecasts, warning ways of severe weather quickly. Download Weather Forecast - Live Weather Radar app to update useful weather features for you.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f If you love the app, please leave us 5 stars so that the development team has more motivation to develop the app <b>Live Weather Forecast \u2013 Local Weather, Live Weather </b> more.",
